<title>MALAYSIA: Westmont proposes rights, special issues.</title>
<headline>Westmont proposes rights, special issues.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian maritime engineering firm Westmont Industries Bhd said in a statement on Friday it was proposing a two-for-five rights issue and a special issue to Bumiputra (ethnic Malay) investors.</p>
<p>The rights issue will be between 93 and 101 million shares and priced at 2.40 ringgit each.</p>
<p>The special issue of 35 million shares will also be priced at 2.40 ringgit.</p>
<p>The minimum of 307.8 million ringgit raised would be used to pay off bank borrowings, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
